      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. some of them are a bit vague for the training set though, like the 'better fit' one. can we get more specific? for example, could you write out a few short dialogue snippets for a couple of these? like, show me exactly how a microaggression might sound in a real meeting or a watercooler chat. maybe focus on a few different racial contexts so the dataset isn't all one-dimensional?",
